---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Tenant Screening Checklist & Scorecard" description="Comprehensive 25-point scorecard with risk categories, verification checklist, and decision page.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/products/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Products</a>

      <h1>Tenant Screening Checklist & Scorecard</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Reduce tenant risk with a comprehensive 25-point scoring system. Assess credit history, employment, references, and rental behavior. Includes risk categorization and decision framework.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What's Included</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>25-Point Scorecard:</strong> Comprehensive tenant assessment framework</li>
          <li><strong>Risk Categorization:</strong> Low, Medium, High risk classifications</li>
          <li><strong>Verification Checklist:</strong> Employment, income, references, criminal history, rental history</li>
          <li><strong>Fillable PDF:</strong> Print and fill by hand or complete digitally</li>
          <li><strong>Excel Workbook:</strong> Automated scoring and decision logic (Pro & Agency tiers)</li>
          <li><strong>Word Template:</strong> Customizable decision letter to tenant (Pro & Agency tiers)</li>
          <li><strong>Decision Page:</strong> Summary and recommendation based on score</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp Cards:</strong> 5 marketing cards (Agency tier only)</li>
          <li><strong>Offline-first:</strong> No subscriptions, no cloud required.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0;">
        <h2>Choose Your Tier</h2>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap:1.5rem; margin-top:1.5rem;">

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Basic</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">For individual landlords making informed screening decisions.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 49</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Printable PDF checklist</li>
              <li>25-point scorecard</li>
              <li>Risk assessment guide</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/8q9f34t894" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Pro</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Professional toolkit with Excel automation and letter templates.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 99</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Fillable PDF + Excel</li>
              <li>Automated scoring</li>
              <li>Word letter template</li>
              <li>Decision framework</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/7q48h4a47a" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Agency</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Complete suite for real estate professionals and screening agencies.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 199</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Full toolkit + templates</li>
              <li>Automated Excel suite</li>
              <li>5 WhatsApp cards</li>
              <li>Bulk screening support</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/64464k1414" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h3>Assessment Categories</h3>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Employment & Income:</strong> Stable employment, income verification, debt-to-income ratio</li>
          <li><strong>Rental History:</strong> Previous landlord references, payment history, evictions</li>
          <li><strong>Credit Profile:</strong> Credit score, outstanding debts, judgments, defaults</li>
          <li><strong>Character & Background:</strong> Criminal history, character references, length of residence</li>
          <li><strong>Risk Classification:</strong> Green (approve), Yellow (caution), Red (reject/additional review)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <p style="margin:0;"><strong>Act 220 Compliant:</strong> Screening process aligns with Ghana's Rent Act, 1963 requirements for tenant selection and dispute prevention.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/contact/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Have Questions? Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
